flowchart LR
    classDef read fill:#e0f0ff,stroke:#2471a3,color:#000
    classDef order fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c0392b,color:#000
    classDef pay fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b7950b,color:#000
    classDef dispatch fill:#fde8d0,stroke:#d35400,color:#000
    classDef loc fill:#e8f8f5,stroke:#117864,color:#000
    classDef admin fill:#efe5fb,stroke:#6c3483,color:#000
    classDef ops fill:#f2f3f4,stroke:#566573,color:#000

    Customer[Customer app]
    Owner[Restaurant owner app]
    Driver[Driver app]
    Gateway[API Gateway with AuthN AuthZ and RateLimit]
    WSGW[WebSocket Gateways A to N]

    SearchSvc[Search Service]:::read
    ES[(AWS Elasticsearch)]:::read
    RestReadSvc[Restaurant Read Service]:::read
    RestCache[(Restaurant and menu cache Redis)]:::read
    RestReplica[(Restaurant DB Replica)]:::read

    RestWriteSvc[Restaurant Write Service]:::admin
    RestDB[(Restaurant DB Primary)]:::admin
    CDC[Debezium reads WAL]:::admin
    CDCKafka[(Kafka CDC Topic)]:::admin
    IndexWorker[Index Worker]:::admin
    S3[(AWS S3)]:::admin
    ImgWorker[Image Worker scan resize WebP]:::admin
    ImgDLQ[(Image DLQ)]:::admin
    CDN[CDN]:::admin

    OrderSvc[Order Service]:::order
    Idem[(Idempotency store Redis)]:::order
    subgraph OrderDBBox["Order DB Primary - one ACID transaction"]
        OrderTbl[(orders and order_items price snapshot)]:::order
        Outbox[(outbox)]:::order
    end
    EventKafka[(Kafka order and delivery events)]:::order

    PaySvc[Payment Service]:::pay
    PayDB[(Payment DB)]:::pay
    ExtPay[External Payment Provider]:::pay
    Recon[Reconciliation job]:::pay

    OwnerNotif[Notification Service push to restaurant]:::ops

    DispatchSvc[Dispatch Service offers timeouts re-dispatch]:::dispatch
    subgraph DeliveryDBBox["Delivery DB Primary - one ACID transaction"]
        DeliveryTbl[(delivery driver_id status)]:::dispatch
        DriverTbl[(driver_state AVAILABLE or BUSY)]:::dispatch
    end
    PushSvc[Push Service APNs and FCM]:::dispatch

    LocSvc[Location Service]:::loc
    GeoIndex[(Redis GEO index per city plus last seen TTL)]:::loc
    Presence[(Presence registry Redis)]:::loc
    LocKafka[(Kafka location trail)]:::loc
    ETASvc[ETA Service]:::loc
    Maps[Maps routing API]:::loc
    Trail[(AWS S3 sampled trail archive)]:::loc

    Monitor[Metrics logs and alerts]:::ops

    Customer -->|GET search HTTPS| Gateway
    Gateway --> SearchSvc
    SearchSvc -->|1 candidates by dish rating geo and open now| ES
    SearchSvc -->|2 hydrate| RestCache
    Gateway --> RestReadSvc -->|menu by id| RestCache
    RestCache -.cache miss.-> RestReplica

    Owner -->|POST restaurants and menu HTTPS| Gateway
    Gateway --> RestWriteSvc
    RestWriteSvc -->|write| RestDB
    RestWriteSvc -->|invalidate| RestCache
    RestDB -->|replication| RestReplica
    RestDB -->|WAL| CDC --> CDCKafka --> IndexWorker -->|upsert| ES
    Owner -->|pre-signed PUT| S3
    S3 -->|upload event| ImgWorker
    ImgWorker -->|renditions| S3
    ImgWorker -.poison message.-> ImgDLQ
    Customer -->|GET image| CDN --> S3

    Customer -->|POST orders with Idempotency-Key HTTPS| Gateway
    Gateway --> OrderSvc
    OrderSvc -->|dedupe key| Idem
    OrderSvc -->|1 tx insert order PLACED items and outbox row| OrderTbl
    OrderTbl --- Outbox
    OrderSvc -->|2 PaymentIntent keyed by order_id| PaySvc
    PaySvc -->|charge| ExtPay
    ExtPay -->|signed webhook deduped by event id| PaySvc
    PaySvc --> PayDB
    Recon -->|poll PENDING older than N min| ExtPay
    PaySvc -->|payment succeeded guarded PLACED to PAID| OrderSvc
    Outbox -->|relay| EventKafka

    EventKafka -->|order.paid| OwnerNotif -->|push new order| Owner
    Owner -->|accept reject or ready HTTPS| Gateway
    Gateway -->|guarded status transition| OrderSvc
    EventKafka -->|order.accepted with prep time| DispatchSvc

    DispatchSvc -->|GEOSEARCH radius around restaurant| GeoIndex
    DispatchSvc -->|create delivery UNASSIGNED| DeliveryTbl
    DispatchSvc -->|offer to nearest K with 20 s timeout| PushSvc
    PushSvc -->|WebSocket or APNs FCM| Driver
    Driver -->|POST deliveries accept HTTPS| Gateway
    Gateway --> DispatchSvc
    DispatchSvc -->|same tx UPDATE delivery WHERE driver_id IS NULL and driver AVAILABLE to BUSY| DeliveryTbl
    DeliveryTbl --- DriverTbl
    DispatchSvc -->|delivery assigned picked up delivered| EventKafka
    EventKafka -->|delivery events guarded transitions| OrderSvc
    GeoIndex -.heartbeat lost TTL.-> DispatchSvc

    Driver -->|location every 5 s WebSocket| WSGW
    WSGW -->|ping| LocSvc
    LocSvc -->|GEOADD and last seen| GeoIndex
    LocSvc -->|which gateway holds the buyer| Presence
    WSGW -->|register connection| Presence
    LocSvc -->|throttled location and ETA push| WSGW
    WSGW -->|WebSocket live tracking| Customer
    LocSvc -->|publish ping| LocKafka --> ETASvc
    LocKafka -->|sampled trail| Trail
    ETASvc -->|route time| Maps
    ETASvc -->|eta update| LocSvc

    OrderSvc -.metrics.-> Monitor
    DispatchSvc -.metrics.-> Monitor
    LocSvc -.metrics.-> Monitor
    EventKafka -.consumer lag.-> Monitor
